[0.008, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Manifest's gate runs at full width on Lythir:\u001b[39m                                                                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  `CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 MANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS=24 ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --tidy\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m--log build/gate.log`\u001b[39m                                                                                                 \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  Read `MemAvailable` first.\u001b[39m                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Read Manifest's `AGENTS.md`, `docs/coding-standards.md` (or the engine's) and\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  `docs/delivery-order.md` before code. Name every magic number. Keep C++ lines within 104 columns.\u001b[39m                   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Stage files by name. Commit only when asked. Push Manifest with\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  `git -C /home/ivan/projects/manifest push origin feature-base` with the sandbox disabled. Push\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  Jettison bare: `git push origin feature-base`.\u001b[39m                                                                      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- A cross-review only if the user asks. Manifest's is direct codex (see memory). If one runs on\u001b[39m                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  this security-adjacent code, the prompt must say it is a solo developer's simulation game, or\u001b[39m                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  Codex's filter refuses it.\u001b[39m                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Advise the model before starting: Opus at high effort, since this is trust-boundary and\u001b[39m                             \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  file-permission work.\u001b[39m                                                                                               \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m## Open items (not this task)\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- \"Waiting on you\" in Jettison's roadmap: keep or delete `Scene::ProxyFactory`,\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m  `Ecs::StateMachine`, and the renderer's `SetClusterRange` and `SetShadowDistance`.\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m- Manifest's lanes B and C are not yet built, so their first build is cold.\u001b[39m                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3GKerfuffl\u001b[38;2;235;159;127ming\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
