[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  (another command ran in this repository at the same time; a change made by either may show under either \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresult)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B Searching for \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m pa\u001b[22Gt\u001b[24Grns, reading \u001b[1m15\u001b[22m fil\u001b[44Gs, listi\u001b[53Gg \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m directories, running\u001b[78G\u001b[1m1\u001b[80G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[86Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ls '/home/ivan/projects/manifest'/data '/home/ivan/projects/manifest'/mods; rg -n \"share/manifest|install\\\\(\" \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B'/home/ivan/projects/manifest'/cmake '/home/ivan/projects/manifest'/scripts/stage-bundle.sh | head -30\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Key file \u001b[16G\u001b[39m\u001b[49m☐\u001b[18GMatch\u001b[24Gby\u001b[28G✔\u001b[30GSubmit\u001b[38G→\r\u001b[2B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhere should the client's pinned server keys live? (Format either way: YAML through Jettison's archive, `version: 1`, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1m`servers: [{endpoint: \"host:port\", key: <64 hex>}]`, read at each `connect`.)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBundle + user override (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mTest builds ship\u001b[23Gshare/man\u001b[33Gfest/serve\u001b[44Gs.yaml be\u001b[54Gid\u001b[58Gmanifest.p\u001b[69Gck (checked\u001b[81Gin, copied\u001b[92Gby the build and \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mstage-bundle.sh); $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/manifest/servers.yaml, when present, is read instead. Same pattern as \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BDefaultContent/DefaultTokens.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Bundle\u001b[13Gonly\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOn\u001b[9Gy\u001b[11Gshare/manifest/s\u001b[28Grvers.yaml beside the pack. Sim\u001b[60Glest, but a player can't add a \u001b[92Gerv\u001b[96Gr withou\u001b[105G edi\u001b[110Ging the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Binstall.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mUser\u001b[11Gconfig\u001b[18Gonly\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnly $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/manifest/\u001b[38Gervers.yaml. Test builds would not carry the key; players paste it in.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0032 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[13;1H"]
