[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G723e8d5\u001b[14GLanes:\u001b[21Gthree\u001b[27Gkept\u001b[32Gworktrees,\u001b[43Gand\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gengine's\u001b[60Glock\u001b[65Gfor\u001b[69Gheavy\u001b[75Gwork\r\u001b[1B     7576f10\u001b[14GDocs: the docs review merged, so its line\u001b[56Gle\u001b[59Gves \"Waiting on you\"\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  (another command ran in this repository at the same time; a change made by either may show under either \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bresult)\u001b[14G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSea\u001b[7Gched for \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m15\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2B●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered Claude's questions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Where should the client's pinned server keys live? (Format either way: YAML through Jettison's archive, `version:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1`, `servers: [{endpoint: \"host:port\", key: <64 hex>}]`, read at each `connect`.) → Bundle + user override \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is a key matched \u001b[30Go\u001b[32Ga server at connect? → E\u001b[57Gact host:por\u001b[71G(Recomme\u001b[80Gd\u001b[82Gd)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBoth recommended options chosen. Setting up lane B and reading the standards, the\u001b[85Gdocs\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gchange\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gpin.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m14\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m13\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFound a\u001b[11G engine gap: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWriteFileDurably\u001b[41G\u001b[39malways\u001b[48Gcreates\u001b[56Gfiles 0644, so a 0600 key file needs a\u001b[95Gpermissions\u001b[107Gparameter\u001b[117Gin\r\u001b[1B  Jettison. Making that small engine change in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison.lane-b\u001b[64G\u001b[39mfirst.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
