[0.077, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 224 \u001b[22m procurement, regional governance and the close of its Stage 4, on the pin `14fc23a`. Its R01\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 225 \u001b[22m (2026-11-24), the save and compatibility contract, a planning task, needed none either and names no\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-b/docs/persistence.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 180 \u001b[22m 3. It is renamed over the target.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 181 \u001b[22m 4. The directory is flushed, since the rename is an entry in the directory.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 182 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 183 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mWhy both flushes are needed is [decided](decisions.md#persistence). On failure it throws              \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m83\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe part\u001b[21Gal fil\u001b[28G is made anew with the permissions the caller gives, 0644 unless told otherwise       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m84\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`Core::kFilePermissions`),\u001b[40Gso\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gfile\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Ggame\u001b[57Gkeeps\u001b[63Gprivate,\u001b[72Gsuch\u001b[77Gas\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gserver's\u001b[91Gsecret\u001b[98Gkey\u001b[102Gat\u001b[105G0600,\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m85\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mis\u001b[15Gnever\u001b[21Gopen\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gothers\u001b[36Gon\u001b[39Gits\u001b[43Gway.\u001b[48GWhy\u001b[52Gboth\u001b[57Gflushes\u001b[65Gare\u001b[69Gneeded\u001b[76Gis\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m86\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecided\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decisions.md#persistence). On failure it throws                                             \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m87\u001b[12G\u001b[22m`std::runtime_error` naming the path, with the partial file removed and the old file as\u001b[100Git\u001b[103Gwas.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m88\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m89\u001b[12G\u001b[22mA\u001b[14Gmissing \u001b[23Girector\u001b[31G is made by `Core::CreateDirectoriesDurably`,\u001b[77Goutermost\u001b[87Gfirst,\u001b[94Geach\u001b[99Gone's\u001b[105Gparent\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BRunn\u001b[13Gshell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m$ git -C '/home/ivan/pr\u001b[30Gjects/jettison.lane-b' diff -\u001b[61Gtat\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
