[0.187, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m4\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 180 \u001b[22m 3. It i\u001b[20G r\u001b[23Gnamed over the target.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 181 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m4. Th\u001b[18G di\u001b[23Gctory\u001b[29Gis flushed,\u001b[41Gsince\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Grename\u001b[58Gis\u001b[61Gan\u001b[64Gentry\u001b[70Gin\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gdirectory.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 183 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mWhy both flushes are needed is [decided](decisions.md#persistence). On failure it throws              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 183 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe partial file is made anew with the permissions the caller gives, 0644 unless told otherwise       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 184 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`Core::kFilePermissions`), so a file a game keeps private, such as a server's secret key at 0600,    \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m5\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mis never open to\u001b[29Gothers on its way. Why both flushes are ne\u001b[72Gded is  \u001b[81G    \u001b[86G      \u001b[93G    \u001b[98G         \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecided\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](decisions.md#persistence). On failure it throws                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 187 \u001b[22m `std::runtime_error` naming the path, with the partial file removed and the old file as it was.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 188 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22mA missing directory is \u001b[36Gade\u001b[40Gby `Core::CreateDirectoriesDurably`, outermost first, each one's parent\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEngine change builds and its \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcore\u001b[39m suite passes. Now writing\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67GManifest\u001b[76Gside:\u001b[82Gkey\u001b[86Gfile,\u001b[92G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--key\u001b[39m,\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gpinned-server\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blist,\u001b[9Gand\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gtests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mWorking…\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
