[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[16B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMake a note, you are allowed to write code, and run an incremental build on it while the gate runs on another \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bworktree. You may even run lightweight testing. What is not allowed to happen is for two gates to run at the same \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btime if they are heavy gates.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mKerfuffling…\u001b[41G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · \u001b[38;2;178;178;178mthinking with high effort\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
