[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 149 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtoken's actor, pinning the server's key from the                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 150 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mserver list\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](server.md#connections-are-sealed); an endpoint the list does not name is refused,       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 151 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mand a server that does not hold the pinned key ends in `Disconnected from ...: key mismatch.`. A      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 152 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfailed connect keeps the connection there was; a new one replaces it. While connected:                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 153 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 154 \u001b[22m - The players' commands drop the principal argument, since the actor is the token's.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 155 \u001b[22m   `provision` needs an administrator's token.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDocs are\u001b[12Gdone.\u001b[18GWaiting\u001b[26Gfor\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gbuild.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMake a note, you are allowed to write code, and run an incremental build on it while the gate runs on another \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mworktree. You may even run lightweight testing. What is not allowed to happen is for two gates to run at the same \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtime if they are heavy gates.\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command, recalling \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory, searching memories…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-b' && CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=24 \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b'/scripts/heavy.sh sh -c 'cmake --preset clang-debug \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m-DJETTISON_SOURCE_DIR='/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b' > build-configure.log 2>&1 && cmake --build --preset \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mclang-debug > build.l…\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
