[0.109, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 153 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 154 \u001b[22m - The players' commands drop the principal argument, since the actor is the token's.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 155 \u001b[22m   `provision` needs an administrator's token.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mDocs are\u001b[12Gdone.\u001b[18GWaiting for the build.\u001b[41G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMake a note, you are allowed to write code, and run an incremental build on it while the gate runs on another \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mworktree. You may even run lightweight testing. What is not allowed to happen is for two gates to run at the same \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mtime if they are heavy gates.\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command, recalled \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory, searched memories \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNoted\u001b[9Gin\u001b[12Gmemory:\u001b[20Gonly\u001b[25Gtwo\u001b[29Gheavy\u001b[35Ggates\u001b[41Gat\u001b[44Gonce\u001b[49Gare\u001b[53Gforbidden;\u001b[64Gedits,\u001b[71Gincremental\u001b[83Gbuilds\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Glight\u001b[100Gtests\u001b[106Gare\u001b[110Gfine\u001b[115Gbeside\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba gate in another lane. The build hit one test compile error.\u001b[65GFixing\u001b[72Git.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearch\u001b[11Gg for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, rec\u001b[32Glling \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m memory, writing \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m memori\u001b[65Gs…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-b' && CMAKE_BUILD_PAR