 0644. It also now replaces a\u001b[47Gartial file left\u001b[64Gby a crash inst\u001b[80Gad of\u001b[86Greusing it, si\u001b[101Gc\u001b[103G reusing it\u001b[115Gwould\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bkeep th\u001b[11G old mode. This\u001b[27Gis\u001b[30Gin\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison.lane-b\u001b[39m,\u001b[50Gbranch\u001b[57G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mprivate-durable-files\u001b[39m,\u001b[80Grecorded\u001b[89Gin\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gengine's\u001b[105Ghistory\u001b[113Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpersistence.md\u001b[39m. So Manifest has to\u001b[38Gbe pinned to that engine commit rather\u001b[77Gthan \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m24bd3ec\u001b[39m;\u001b[91Gth\u001b[94G dev\u001b[99Gshell files\u001b[111Ghaven't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchanged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7G              \u001b[22G   \u001b[26G     \u001b[32G   \u001b[36G        \u001b[45G  \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
