[0.106, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI noticed a lot of the code has comments blocks that precede code blocks, and those have no whitespace linefeed \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mbetween them and a previous code block. All code blocks should have a linefeed whitespace after them, except when \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthey are the final block in that nested {}. Please update the line spacing script to ensure this happens, add it to \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthe coding standards, and go back and apply it to all the existing code.\u001b[39m                                              \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Big one; I'll take it in a separate lane while the Manifest gate runs. First, a look at the existing spacing script\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  and the rule it enforces.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI'm\u001b[7Gadding a bl\u001b[19Gnk\u001b[22Gline before standalone \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m//\u001b[39m comm\u001b[53Gnts that follow a finished statement or block in\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mscripts/space-declarations.py\u001b[39m,\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38GI'll\u001b[43Gprototype\u001b[53Gthat\u001b[58Gin\u001b[61G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mjettison.lane-c\u001b[77G\u001b[39mfor\u001b[81Greview\u001b[88Gfirst.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mRunning cd '/home/ivan/proj\u001b[31Gcts/mani\u001b[40Gest.lane-b' &&\u001b[55GCMAKE…\u001b[K\r\u001b[4B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3GRetic\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mula\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mting… \u001b[43G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 23s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
