s one whole cartridge the same way (a tote holds two) and\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 103 \u001b[22m   installs it fresh in place of the installed cartridge with the least left. The old cartridge is\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m104 \u001b[22m \u001b[13G thrown\u001b[21Gaway\u001b[26Gwith\u001b[31Gwhatever\u001b[40Git\u001b[43Ghad.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BRunning \u001b[1m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[70C\u001b[3B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mImagining…\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
