[0.082, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThe \u001b[12Grading fixture is \u001b[31Geft with 7,833\u001b[46Gcredits\u001b[54Gafter\u001b[60Gits\u001b[64Gcopper\u001b[71Gbuy.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BDrinking water's base price\u001b[35Gr\u001b[37Gses from\u001b[46G8 to 10.67 a k\u001b[61Glolitre, so a tote\u001b[80Gstays\u001b[86Gabout\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gcredit\u001b[101G(D-093).\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThe developm\u001b[20Gnt fixture's player buys soap instead of rice at Forge, because its foods\u001b[94Gsell out there\u001b[110GThat\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gs\u001b[9Gortag\u001b[15G is real: the scenarios'\u001b[40Gstock is coun\u001b[55Gd in totes, and a tote now hold\u001b[89Gewer\u001b[94Gunits. Rescaling the\u001b[115Gstocks\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bwould fix it but changes behaviour the\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtrade\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompany\u001b[39m \u001b[65Guites\u001b[71Gcheck,\u001b[78Gs\u001b[80G I left\u001b[88Git as\u001b[94Ga balanc\u001b[103G question.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe four p\u001b[18Gnned world hash\u001b[34Gs moved\u001b[42Gwith the co\u001b[54Gtent, and\u001b[64Gevery replay still\u001b[83Gmatches\u001b[91Gits uninterrupt\u001b[107Gd ru\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1m4ba44d7\u001b[22m\u001b[39m is\u001b[16Gthe \u001b[21Gncryption work, with\u001b[42Gthe publi\u001b[52G key in\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gserving line\u001b[77Gand the engine pinned \u001b[100Go \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m7a2d936\u001b[39m. Manifest's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfull gate passed (63 of 63 suites plus tidy) before\u001b[57Gthe push.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mComment spacing:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mRule:\u001b[22m a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m//\u001b[39m comment\u001b[24Gthat\u001b[29Gfollows\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gend\u001b[45Gof\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gstatement\u001b[60Gor\u001b[63Gblock\u001b[69Ggets\u001b[74Gone\u001b[78Gblank\u001b[84Gline