[0.044, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Both repos' feature-base are pushed and clean:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Jettison 82848fe \"Format: a blank line above a comment that follows code\".\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manifest 4558791 \"Format: the engine's declaration and comment spacing applied\".\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manifest pins Jettison 7a2d936. The commit after it is blank lines only, so no re-pin is needed.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- All lanes are parked, detached at feature-base: jettison.lane-b/c, manifest.lane-b/c.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Recently done:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- J01 adopted in Manifest: sealed connections, `manifest-token key`, `--serve --key`, and the client pins the key \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom servers.yaml.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manifest's suites fixed for the tote rescale (80d1df7).\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The comment-spacing rule is in scripts/space-declarations.py and the coding standards. It applies to Manifest with\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`--root`. No formatting change ever reaches inside a string or other literal.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mOpen question, a balance one, not urgent: the scenarios' stock is counted in totes, and a tote now holds fewer units, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mso foods sell out at Forge. The development fixture buys soap instead of rice to get around it. Rescaling the stocks \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mchanges behaviour that the trade and company suites check.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNext: read docs/roadmap.md and ../manifest/docs/delivery-order.md for the next task. Run scripts/lanes.sh to pick a \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blane. Tell me the model and effort you recommend before you start. Follow AGENTS.md, the coding standards and memory: \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommit only when I ask, stage files by name, one heavy gate at a time, and push with the sandbox disabled.\r\u001b[28C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3\u001b[31G1\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
