[1.811, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G- \u001b[1mManifest\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m4558791\u001b[39m \"Format: the engine's declaration\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gcomment\u001b[68Gspacing\u001b[76Gapplied\"\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gskipped the full gates for this, as your rule allows for whitespace-only changes. The\u001b[91Gformat\u001b[98Gcheck,\u001b[105G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomment-only.sh\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mand every suite passed beforehand (32 of 32 in Jettison, 63 of 63 in Manifest). Lanes C and B are parked\u001b[108Gon\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-ba\u001b[14Ge\u001b[39m and their branches deleted.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BHandoff prompt for the next session:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mContinue Je\u001b[15Gtison/Mani\u001b[26Gest work. Sta\u001b[40Ge as of 2026-11-26:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Both repos' feature-base ar\u001b[34Gpushed \u001b[42Gnd clean:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Jettison 82848fe \"Format: a blank line above a comment that follows code\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manifest 4558791 \"Format:\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gen\u001b[40Gi\u001b[42Ge's d\u001b[48Gclaration and comment spacing appli\u001b[84Gd\".\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manifest pins\u001b[21GJettison 7a2d936. The commit aft\u001b[54Gr it i\u001b[61G blank lines only, so no re-pin is need\u001b[101Gd.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- All lan\u001b[13Gs are parked, d\u001b[29Gtached\u001b[37Gt feature-base: jettison.lane-b/c, manifest.lane-b/c.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- Recently done:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- J01 \u001b[13Gopted in Manifest: sealed connecti\u001b[48Gn\u001b[50G, `manifest-token key`, `--s\u