[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- All lanes are parked, detached at feature-base: jettison.lane-b/c, manifest.lane-b/c.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Rec\u001b[9Gn\u001b[11Gly done:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mJ01 adopted in Manifest: sealed co\u001b[42Gnections, `manifest-t\u001b[64Gken key`, `--serve --key`, and the client pins the key \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom serv\u001b[13Grs.yaml.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- Manif\u001b[14Gt's suites fix\u001b[29Gd for the\u001b[39Gtote \u001b[46Gsc\u001b[49Gl\u001b[51G (80d1df7)\u001b[62G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m- The comme\u001b[17Gt-spacing rule is in scripts/space-declarations.py and the coding standards. It applies to Manifest with\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B`-\u001b[6Groot`. No formatti\u001b[25Gg change ev\u001b[37Gr\u001b[39Greaches i\u001b[50Gide \u001b[55G string \u001b[64Gr oth\u001b[70Gr literal.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mOpen question,\u001b[18Ga balance one, no\u001b[36G urgent: the scenarios' stock is counted in totes, and a tote now holds fewer units, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bso foods sell out \u001b[22Gt Forge. The\u001b[35Gdevelopment fixtur\u001b[54G buys s\u001b[62Gap instead of\u001b[76Grice to get \u001b[90Gound it. Rescaling the stocks \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mchanges behavi\u001b[18Gur \u001b[22Ghat the trad\u001b[35G and company su\u001b[51Gt\u001b[53Gs check.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mNext: r\u001b[11Gad docs/ro\u001b[22Gdmap.md and ../manifest/doc\u001b[50G/delivery-order.md\u001b[69Gf\u001b[71Gr \u001b[74Ghe\u001b[77Gnex\u001b[81G \u001b[83Ga\u001b[85Gk. Run scripts/lanes.\u001b[107Gh to pick a \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlane. Tell me\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gmodel and\u001b[31Geffort you r\u001b[44Gcommend b\u001b[54Gfore you start. Follow AGENTS.md,\u001b[88Gthe cod\u001b[96Gng\u001b[99Gstandards\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gmemory: \r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bommit only when I ask, stage files by name,\u001b[48Gone heavy gate at a time, and push with the sandbox disabled.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 1m 7s · done 12:07 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GBooping… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msent 1506 chars via OSC 52 · if past\u001b[40G fails, hold Shift (Option in iTerm2, Fn in Terminal.app) while selecting for …\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
